#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/dataset-preparation.md:2
msgid "数据准备：打包行囊"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/dataset-preparation.md:4
msgid "打包行囊——数据怎么从硬盘飞到 GPU？"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/dataset-preparation.md:6
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"装备有了。出发前最后一件事：**打包行囊。** 数据不会自己变成张量。{doc}`cnn-basics` 教会了 CNN "
"如何提取特征，但数据从哪里来、怎么从硬盘飞到 GPU——这是登山前必须解决的。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/dataset-preparation.md:8
msgid "本节回答这个问题，打造一条完整的数据流水线：从原始数据 → 预处理 → Dataset → DataLoader → GPU。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/dataset-preparation.md:11
msgid "数据流水线概览"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/dataset-preparation.md:21
msgid ""
"从右往左看：**PyTorch 不需要你知道文件存在哪里，它只需要一个能`按索引返回(图片, 标签)`的对象**——这就是 "
"Dataset。DataLoader 负责在这个对象上自动打包成 batch、打乱顺序、多进程预加载。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/dataset-preparation.md:23
msgid "第一步：数据从哪里来"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/dataset-preparation.md:25
msgid "内置数据集（最省心）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/dataset-preparation.md:27
msgid ""
"对于 MNIST、CIFAR-10、ImageNet 等经典基准数据集，PyTorch 通过 `torchvision.datasets` "
"一行代码下载并准备好："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/dataset-preparation.md:29
msgid ""
"import torchvision\n"
"\n"
"# 下载 MNIST（第一次自动下载，之后复用本地缓存）\n"
"train_data = torchvision.datasets.MNIST(\n"
"    root='./data',      # 本地缓存目录\n"
"    train=True,         # 训练集\n"
"    download=True       # 第一次运行时设为 True\n"
")\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/dataset-preparation.md:40
msgid "常用内置数据集"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/dataset-preparation.md:52
msgid "自定义数据集（真实项目）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/dataset-preparation.md:54
msgid "真实场景中你的数据通常是以文件夹形式组织的："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/dataset-preparation.md:56
msgid ""
"data/\n"
"├── train/\n"
"│   ├── cat/        # 按类别分文件夹\n"
"│   │   ├── cat_001.jpg\n"
"│   │   ├── cat_002.jpg\n"
"│   │   └── ...\n"
"│   ├── dog/\n"
"│   └── ...\n"
"└── test/\n"
"    ├── cat/\n"
"    ├── dog/\n"
"    └── ...\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/dataset-preparation.md:71
msgid "对于这种结构，`torchvision.datasets.ImageFolder` 直接读取："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/dataset-preparation.md:73
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"from torchvision.datasets import ImageFolder\n"
"\n"
"# 自动按文件夹名分配标签：cat→0, dog→1, ...\n"
"dataset = ImageFolder(root='data/train')\n"
"print(dataset.classes)      # ['cat', 'dog', ...]\n"
"print(dataset.class_to_idx) # {'cat': 0, 'dog': 1, ...}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/dataset-preparation.md:83
msgid ""
"ImageFolder 要求数据按**文件夹名 = 类别名**组织。如果你的数据是 CSV/JSON/X光片等非图像格式，就需要自己写 "
"Dataset 类（见第六步）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/dataset-preparation.md:86
msgid "第二步：Transform——从图像到张量"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/dataset-preparation.md:88
msgid "原始图像是 JPEG/PNG 文件（像素值 0\\~255），不能直接喂给神经网络，需要**三步标准处理**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/dataset-preparation.md:97
msgid "ToTensor：格式转换 + 归一化"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/dataset-preparation.md:99
msgid ""
"transforms.ToTensor()  # 做了两件事：\n"
"                      # 1. PIL Image (H×W×C) → Tensor (C×H×W)\n"
"                      # 2. [0, 255] → [0.0, 1.0]\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/dataset-preparation.md:105
msgid "Normalize：标准化"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/dataset-preparation.md:107
msgid "图像数据中，像素强度差异很大（背景暗、文字亮）。标准化让每个通道的均值为 0、方差为 1，**帮助梯度下降更稳定地收敛**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/dataset-preparation.md:109
msgid ""
"from torchvision import transforms\n"
"\n"
"transform = transforms.Compose([\n"
"    transforms.ToTensor(),\n"
"    # (x - mean) / std，mean 和 std 是数据集的统计值\n"
"    # MNIST 是灰度图，所以只有 1 个通道\n"
"    transforms.Normalize((0.1307,), (0.3081,))\n"
"])\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/dataset-preparation.md:120
msgid ""
"这里的 `(0.1307,)` 和 `(0.3081,)` 是从整个 MNIST "
"训练集计算出来的**全局均值和标准差**。它们的作用是让模型输入具有统一的数值范围，不受亮度、对比度的影响。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/dataset-preparation.md:122
msgid "**对于彩色图像**（如 CIFAR-10）每个通道分别标准化："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/dataset-preparation.md:124
msgid ""
"# CIFAR-10 的 RGB 三通道统计值\n"
"transform = transforms.Compose([\n"
"    transforms.ToTensor(),\n"
"    transforms.Normalize(\n"
"        mean=(0.4914, 0.4822, 0.4465),  # R/G/B 各通道均值\n"
"        std=(0.2023, 0.1994, 0.2010)    # R/G/B 各通道标准差\n"
"    )\n"
"])\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/dataset-preparation.md:135
msgid "训练集与验证集的 transform 不同"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/dataset-preparation.md:137
msgid "这是实践中最常犯的错误之一：**验证集和测试集不能做数据增强**，只能用标准的 ToTensor + Normalize。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/dataset-preparation.md:139
msgid ""
"# 训练集 transform：可做数据增强\n"
"train_transform = transforms.Compose([\n"
"    transforms.RandomRotation(10),        # 随机旋转 ±10°\n"
"    transforms.RandomAffine(0, translate=(0.1, 0.1)),  # 随机平移 ±10%\n"
"    transforms.ToTensor(),\n"
"    transforms.Normalize((0.1307,), (0.3081,))\n"
"])\n"
"\n"
"# 验证/测试集 transform：只做标准化\n"
"val_transform = transforms.Compose([\n"
"    transforms.ToTensor(),\n"
"    transforms.Normalize((0.1307,), (0.3081,))\n"
"])\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/dataset-preparation.md:155
msgid "为什么验证集不能做数据增强？"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/practice-peak/dataset-preparation.md:158
msgid "数据增强（旋转、平移、翻转）本质上是在**制造\"假样本\"**来扩增训练数据。但在验证时，我们需要**评估模型在真实数据上的表现**——如果验证集也被增强了，评估结果就不反映真实性能了。就像你平时用模拟题练习（数据增强），但考试时题目必须是原题（无增强）。"
msgstr ""

